# Robot 1 v1, the autonomous "R1 Launch and Park" (autos/LaunchAndPark.java), as RED (BLUE is the same
# route from the blue wall: the field is turned, not mirrored). From the start spot it backs 4 in off the
# wall, fires the four preloaded POLLEN at our HIVE's up CELL (realistic scatter), then drives to our
# LOADING ZONE and parks partly in it, 2 in or more from every wall: LEAVE 3 + PARK 5.
# How many shots score depends on the shot angle and speed in the robot file (estimates until measured):
# with the robot file's 147 degrees (33 up) no shot can reach an up CELL from anywhere, so this file
# checks that all four are FIRED and prints the verdicts and the score; it does not demand CELL points.
# Run it: the "Simulator tests" button in Android Studio (all tests), or from the ftc-helper-lib folder:
#   ./gradlew :sim:scenario -Pfile=../simulator/scenarios/r1-auto.sim
robot ../robot.properties
set scatter realistic
init "R1 Launch and Park"
press g1.b                                 # RED
wait 0.5                                   # the robot is placed on the chosen side
expect screen has "Place robot : Nose corner on wall 20.5in from R, back at HIVE"
expect robot x = 52 0.3                    # the start spot (RED: the simulator's field numbers are ours)
expect robot y = -59.45 0.3                # front-right corner on the red wall (G304)
expect robot heading = -142.2 1            # the back aimed at the HIVE's up CELL
expect stored = 4                          # four preloaded
expect shape intake_arm = 95 0.1           # folded (inside the 18 in cube)
start
expect within 1 shape intake_arm = 95 0.1  # still folded: it would fall onto the wall here
expect within 12 launched >= 4             # all four fired
expect stored = 0
expect within 6 shape intake_arm = -40 0.1    # pushed over once it is off the wall
expect within 20 screen has "Into the LOADING ZONE"   # the last step is running...
expect time < 25                           # ...well inside the 30 s (seconds since START)
expect within 5 phase STOPPED              # and the autonomous ends by itself
wait 0.5
expect screen has "Fire all: done (4 fired)"
expect screen has "Into the LOADING ZONE: done"
expect screen not "skipped"                # no step skipped or cut short for park time
expect screen not "cut short"
expect bumped none                         # touched no wall or field element on the way
# Parked partly in the red LOADING ZONE (x -46.6..-23.9, y up to -59.1), touching nothing: the ramp's back
# (9.45 in behind the centre) at least 2 in from the red wall (y -70.585), the sides far from any wall.
expect robot y > -59.1
expect robot y < -53
expect robot x > -42
expect robot x < -29
expect robot heading = 0 5
expect points "red" >= 18                  # 10 already on the field for red + LEAVE 3 + PARK 5 (+ TELEOP park now)
print pieces                               # the shots' verdicts and the score
expect error none
